      "id": "u3-theory-4",
      "type": "theory",
      "title": "Les verbes pronominaux (Возвратные глаголы) — Présent",
      "content": "<p style='margin-bottom:1rem'>Возвратные глаголы используют местоимения <strong>me, te, se, nous, vous, se</strong> перед глаголом.</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:1rem 0'><tr><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>Лицо</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>se lever</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>se coucher</th><th style='padding:0.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2)'>se laver</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>je</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>me lève</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>me couche</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#60a5fa'>me lave</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>tu</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>te lèves</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>te couches</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#34d399'>te laves</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>il/elle/on</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#c084fc'>se lève</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#c084fc'>se couche</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#c084fc'>se lave</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>nous</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#fb923c'>nous levons</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#fb923c'>nous couchons</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#fb923c'>nous lavons</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>vous</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#f472b6'>vous levez</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#f472b6'>vous couchez</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#f472b6'>vous lavez</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:0.4rem'>ils/elles</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#a78bfa'>se lèvent</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#a78bfa'>se couchent</td><td style='padding:0.4rem;color:#a78bfa'>se lavent</td></tr></table><p style='padding:1rem;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15);border-radius:8px'>⚠️ В отрицании: <em>Je <strong>ne me lève pas</strong> tôt.</em> — Я не встаю рано.<br>Перед гласной: me→m', te→t', se→s': <em>il s'habille, je m'habille</em></p>"
